# Input spec for requirements-base.txt (the compiled lock).
#
# Scope: the "common set" — everything the majority of notebooks need, plus the
# transitive PyPI dependencies of the bietlejuice wheels. Mirrors the PyPI half
# of packages/bietlejuice-compiler/scripts/emr_init_script.sh so a notebook sees
# the same library surface as the ETL job it is debugging.
#
# NOT here (installed separately in Dockerfile.emr-serverless from S3, because
# they are private wheels that pip cannot resolve from PyPI):
#   bietlejuice_core, bietlejuice_runtime, quintoandar_logger, inmetro,
#   quintoandar_*_api_client
#
# NOT here (deliberately excluded):
#   pyspark            — EMR ships it; installing from PyPI shadows the bundled copy
#   delta-spark        — pinned to 3.3.2 with --no-deps in the Dockerfile to match
#                        EMR 7.12's native Delta, same as emr_init_script.sh
#   validations-engine — declares requests==2.28.1; installed --no-deps
#
# Heavy geo/ML/NLP packages live in requirements-heavy.in.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   make lock-emr-serverless-notebook

